  <div class="tag">Supply Chain Intelligence</div>

  <h1>ABC/XYZ Classification<br><span>The Matrix That Saves Your Cash</span></h1>

  <p class="subtitle">Not all your SKUs are equal. Classify them by revenue impact (ABC) AND demand variability (XYZ). The intersection tells you exactly how to treat each product.</p>

  <div class="formula-bar">
    <code>ABC = Revenue Impact &nbsp;&nbsp;x&nbsp;&nbsp; XYZ = Demand Variability</code>
  </div>

  <div class="matrix-container">
    <table class="matrix-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th></th>
          <th>X: Predictable</th>
          <th>Y: Moderate</th>
          <th>Z: Erratic</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <th>A: Top 20% Revenue</th>
          <td class="ax-cell"><strong>AX</strong><br>Cash cows<br>Review weekly</td>
          <td class="az-cell"><strong>AY</strong><br>Seasonal stars<br>Budget buffer</td>
          <td><strong>AZ</strong><br>Promotion-driven<br>Order small, often</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th>B: Mid 30% Revenue</th>
          <td><strong>BX</strong><br>Steady earners<br>Standard reorder</td>
          <td><strong>BY</strong><br>Watch closely<br>Flexible safety stock</td>
          <td><strong>BZ</strong><br>Unreliable income<br>Consider drop-ship</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th>C: Bottom 50% Revenue</th>
          <td><strong>CX</strong><br>Niche staples<br>Low cost to hold</td>
          <td><strong>CY</strong><br>Marginal &amp; variable<br>Minimal stock</td>
          <td class="cx-cell"><strong>CZ</strong><br>Cash traps<br>Drop or make-to-order</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="legend">
      <div class="legend-item ax">
        <h3>AX = Protect at All Costs</h3>
        <p>Tight safety stock. Weekly reviews. Never let these run out. They carry your revenue.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="legend-item az">
        <h3>AZ = Order Smarter</h3>
        <p>High revenue but unpredictable. Order smaller batches, more frequently. Don't bet big on one PO.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="legend-item cz">
        <h3>CZ = Let Go</h3>
        <p>Low revenue, erratic demand. These are your cash traps. Consider dropping them or switching to make-to-order.</p>
      </div>
